description:
**Summary:**




 Sciente Group is a multi\-award winning, ISO9001/Great Place to Work/Personal Data Protection Trustmark/ISO27001 certified, Singapore headquartered technology focused organisation with business interest in Singapore (HQ), USA, Malaysia, Philippines and India.










**Currently, we are expanding our India tech recruitment consulting team to support our APAC business growth of business technology consulting, DATA \& AI solutions, and tech talent services.** 










 Our mission: Delighted clients \& community.




 Our employee value proposition: Learning \& Development, Career Growth and Sincere \& Approachable leadership.




 Therefore we promise a stable long\-term career growth for you.










**What is expected from this role to start with?**









* **Build and manage a team of TAs for APAC region and to ensure the desired key performance indicators (KPIs) are achieved by the team on a monthly basis**
* Team members must follow a consultative approach to understand the on\-site IT job role requirements \& expectations we have in Asia Pacific (APAC);
* Understand various technologies involved in the role and how it works;
* Derive an effective sourcing strategy to reach out to right group of tech talents within the APAC country of job role;
* Understand the matching skills/capabilities/aspirations of the tech talents;
* Guide talents for their career progression in a consultative manner (candidate management);
* Work closely with on\-site client facing managers/business development managers;
* Present the right talent profiles to the clients or client facing managers;
* Own\-up and build good rapport/relationship with the shortlisted candidates through out the process;
* Manage shortlisted candidates proactively with a consultative approach;
* Facilitate the matching/hiring process for the client to hire the right talents, bingo! That's what is expected from this role.









**Who shall fit\-in the best for this role?**









* Relevant work experience of 10 years in executive search or IT talent acquisition or tech recruitment in client servicing environment shall be needed;
* **At least 3 years of recent work experience of leading a team for Singapore, Malaysia, Philippines clients is a "MUST";**
* **You must have a proven track record in leading a productive team of consultants serving APAC region** 
 ;
* Communication, inter\-personal skills, meticulous and result\-orientation are the most important attributes for this role;
* Having a mind\-set of delivering value to make candidates/clients succeed and commitment to the purpose of the role;
* Positive attitude to put\-in efforts to achieve the desired goals shall make you a good fit for this role;
* Education in engineering or computer science related discipline shall be highly desired;
* This being a tech specialised role, ability to keep learning is one of the key success factors for this role.









 Should you be interested in this opportunity, please send in your updated resume to HR@sciente.com at the earliest. To know more, please visit https://www.sciente.com










 When you apply, you voluntarily consent to the disclosure, collection and use of your personal data for employment/recruitment and related purposes in accordance with the SCIENTE Group Privacy Policy, a copy of which is published at SCIENTE’s website (https://www.sciente.com/privacy\-policy).










 Confidentiality is assured, and only shortlisted candidates will be notified for interviews.
